erflow checks for the workspace release profile and adds a release-mode regression that requires a runtime usize overflow to panic. The standard check target now runs that regression.\n\nChecked-release boot testing exposed two eager rejected-branch underflows, which now use lazy conditional evaluation. The larger checked binaries also required bounded capacity updates: the root image publication limit is 164 pages, and the network image uses a canonical 161-page capacity shared by its loader and validator.\n\nVerification:\n- make check\n- make test\n- make test-qemu-smoke\n- post-change EFI 70,135,296 bytes, +72,192 bytes or about 0.103%\n- final cached smoke 9.54 seconds versus 9.22-second coarse baseline\n\nPlease keep issue #43 open until maintainer review. This PR does not merge or close anything.", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2026-11-02T04:59:31Z", "updated_at": "2026-11-02T19:00:56Z", "closed_at": null, "merged_at": null, "merge_commit_sha": null, "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "gmkurtzer:hdae/issue-43-release-overflow", "ref": "hdae/issue-43-release-overflow", "repo": {"id": 1413787216, "node_id": "R_kgDOVESuUA", "name": "ginux", "full_name": "gmkurtzer/ginux", "owner": {"login": "gmkurtzer", "id": 13984965, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjEzOTg0OTY1", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13984965?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer", "html_url": "https://github.com/gmkurtzer", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/gmkurtzer/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/us